# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# D-HRM Backend — Environment Variable Template
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your real values.
# .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Database ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# PostgreSQL JDBC connection string
DB_URL=jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/dhrm
DB_USERNAME=postgres
DB_PASSWORD=change-me

# ── JWT Security ─────────────────────────────────────────
# REQUIRED — minimum 64 random characters
# Generate: openssl rand -hex 64
JWT_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-secret-at-least-64-chars
# Token lifetime in milliseconds (default 24 h = 86400000)
JWT_EXPIRATION_MS=86400000

# ── Email (Brevo) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave blank to disable transactional email (password reset)
BREVO_API_KEY=
BREVO_SENDER_EMAIL=
BREVO_SENDER_NAME=Daloft People

# ── Frontend URLs ─────────────────────────────────────────
APP_FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
FRONTEND_RESET_PASSWORD_URL=http://localhost:3000/reset-password

# ── CORS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Comma-separated list of allowed origins
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000

# ── Bootstrap System Admin (first-run only) ───────────────
# These seed the very first SYSTEM_ADMIN account.
# After the account is created you may remove or leave these.
ADMIN_EMPLOYEE_ID=SYS001
ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me-immediately
ADMIN_NAME=System Administrator
ADMIN_DEPARTMENT=Administration

# ── Geofence Attendance (optional) ───────────────────────
GEOFENCE_ENABLED=false
# OFFICE_LATITUDE=0.0
# OFFICE_LONGITUDE=0.0
# OFFICE_GEOFENCE_RADIUS_METERS=100
# MAX_GPS_ACCURACY_METERS=100

# ── Attendance Policy Overrides (optional) ────────────────
# ATTENDANCE_OFFICE_START_TIME=09:00
# ATTENDANCE_GRACE_MINUTES=30
# ATTENDANCE_REQUIRED_MINUTES=420
# ATTENDANCE_HALF_DAY_MINUTES=210

# ── Server ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# PORT=8080

# ── Flyway ────────────────────────────────────────────────
FLYWAY_ENABLED=true
